{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the chaos with this 100% free demo and get access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 missions: two prologues and one full mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully replayable mission with 4 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique Disaster abilities (out of 12 total)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tornado</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Respiratory Outbreak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asteroid Impact</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hours of strategic, world-ending gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.poster.avif?t=1754229274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.webm?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.mp4?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH DESTRUCTION ON AN EPIC SCALE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our unique technology simulates over 80,000* humans simultaneously on screen as you deploy devastating plagues, natural catastrophes, global conflicts and more tragedies. Designed using real-world data for an authentic simulation of humanity\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MORE THAN JUST A 2D SIMULATION</strong>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch disasters unfold in real-time, dynamically evolving and spreading based on your strategic choices. Combine different disasters to create chain reactions and watch civilization collapse before your eyes. Humanity won't go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MULTIPLE WAYS TO END THE WORLD</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven campaign with varied extinction scenarios, or test your strategic prowess in challenging game modes. With dozens of hours of replayable content, every playthrough offers new strategies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.poster.avif?t=1754229274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.webm?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.mp4?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b\u200b\u200b<strong>SANDBOX MODE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want pure destructive freedom? Sandbox mode removes all restrictions, letting you unleash any combination of disasters at will. Create your own scenarios and experiment with different doomsday combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u200b*Number may be lower depending on players' hardware.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836320?t=1754229274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836320?t=1754229274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/2b0da095fcadd2a0df6182acbea8120bf3d27301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754229274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/2b0da095fcadd2a0df6182acbea8120bf3d27301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754229274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the chaos with this 100% free demo and get access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 missions: two prologues and one full mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully replayable mission with 4 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique Disaster abilities (out of 12 total)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tornado</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Respiratory Outbreak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asteroid Impact</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hours of strategic, world-ending gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.poster.avif?t=1754229274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.webm?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/9701e16d96da87b1aefbe09b1885034b.mp4?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH DESTRUCTION ON AN EPIC SCALE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our unique technology simulates over 80,000* humans simultaneously on screen as you deploy devastating plagues, natural catastrophes, global conflicts and more tragedies. Designed using real-world data for an authentic simulation of humanity\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MORE THAN JUST A 2D SIMULATION</strong>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch disasters unfold in real-time, dynamically evolving and spreading based on your strategic choices. Combine different disasters to create chain reactions and watch civilization collapse before your eyes. Humanity won't go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MULTIPLE WAYS TO END THE WORLD</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven campaign with varied extinction scenarios, or test your strategic prowess in challenging game modes. With dozens of hours of replayable content, every playthrough offers new strategies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.poster.avif?t=1754229274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.webm?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.mp4?t=1754229274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b\u200b\u200b<strong>SANDBOX MODE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want pure destructive freedom? Sandbox mode removes all restrictions, letting you unleash any combination of disasters at will. Create your own scenarios and experiment with different doomsday combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u200b*Number may be lower depending on players' hardware.</i></p>","developers":["DryGin Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2682380","name":"Extinction Day"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836320/f31e107e6559d8d96116722bfbeed68c28ec7557/header.jpg?t=1754229274","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168742,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168742/movie480.mp4?t=1753706679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168742/movie_max.mp4?t=1753706679"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168742/fe8e2da5759e0b7ec08be1f46ef1c98e0267c05f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753706679","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168742/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753706679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168742/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753706679"}}],"name":"Extinction Day Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 550 4 GB VRAM / NVIDIA GTX 1050Ti 4 GB VRAM<b